<title>USA: Magnetek to redeem 8 pct notes due 2001.</title>
<headline>Magnetek to redeem 8 pct notes due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>MagneTek Inc said on Tuesday it intends to redeem $35 million of its outstanding 8 percent convertible subordinated notes due 2001.</p>
<p>MagneTek said in a news release that currently there are $75 million of these notes outstanding.</p>
<p>The redemption price for each $1,000 principal amount note will be $1,035.60 plus accrued interest of $21.78, the company said.</p>
<p>Notes that have not been called for redemption can be converted into MagneTek common shares at the holder's option, MagneTek said.</p>
<p>MagneTek makes integrated electrical products.</p>
</text>
